{"speciesId":191,"names":{"fr":"Tournegrin","es":"Sunkern","en":"Sunkern","ja":"ヒマナッツ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It may drop out of the sky suddenly. If attacked by a SPEAROW, it will violently shake its leaves."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It lives by drink­ ing only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It is very weak. Its only means of defense is to shake its leaves desperately at its attacker."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SUNKERN tries to move as little as it possibly can. It does so because it tries to conserve all the nutrients it has stored in its body for its evolution. It will not eat a thing, subsisting only on morning dew."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SUNKERN tries to move as little as it possibly can. It does so because it tries to conserve all the nutrients it has stored in its body for its evolution. It will not eat a thing, subsisting only on morning dew."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"SUNKERN try to minimize movement to conserve the nutrients they have stored in their bodies for evolution. They will not eat, subsisting only on morning dew."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It may drop out of the sky suddenly. If attacked by a SPEAROW, it will violently shake its leaves."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It may plummet from the sky. If attacked by a SPEAROW, it will violently shake its leaves."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il tombe du ciel sans crier gare en matinée. On en croise énormément l’année suivant un été froid."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il tombe du ciel sans crier gare en matinée. On en croise énormément l’année suivant un été froid."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. Knowing it’s weak, it simply feeds until it evolves."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. Knowing it’s weak, it simply feeds until it evolves."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il tombe du ciel soudainement. S’il est attaqué par un Piafabec, il secoue violemment ses feuilles."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Puede caer del cielo de repente. Si le ataca un Spearow, moverá violentamente sus hojas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It may plummet from the sky. If attacked by a Spearow, it will violently shake its leaves."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ある朝 突然 降ってくる。 オニスズメに 襲われると 葉っぱを 激しく 振って 追い払う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vit en buvant la rosée sur les feuilles. On dit qu’il ne peut rien avaler d’autre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se alimenta del rocío que hay sobre las hojas de las plantas. Dicen que no come nada más."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"葉っぱの 裏側に たまった 朝露だけを 飲んで 暮らす。 他には なにも 食べないという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tournegrin essaie de bouger le moins possible. C’est parce qu’il veut conserver tous les nutriments qu’il stocke dans son corps pour son évolution. Il ne mange pas, ne subsistant que grâce à la rosée matinale."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sunkern intenta moverse lo menos posible para conservar todos los nutrientes que ha guardado en su interior y poder evolucionar. Ni come siquiera; se alimenta solo del rocío de la mañana."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sunkern tries to move as little as it possibly can. It does so because it tries to conserve all the nutrients it has stored in its body for its evolution. It will not eat a thing, subsisting only on morning dew."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体に ためた 栄養は 進化の ときまで 取っておくため ほとんど 動こうとしない。 なにも 食べずに 朝露 だけを 飲んでいる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tournegrin essaie de bouger le moins possible. C’est parce qu’il veut conserver tous les nutriments qu’il stocke dans son corps pour son évolution. Il ne mange pas, ne subsistant que grâce à la rosée matinale."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sunkern intenta moverse lo menos posible para conservar todos los nutrientes que ha guardado en su interior y poder evolucionar. Ni come siquiera; se alimenta solo del rocío de la mañana."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sunkern tries to move as little as it possibly can. It does so because it tries to conserve all the nutrients it has stored in its body for its evolution. It will not eat a thing, subsisting only on morning dew."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体に ためた 栄養は 進化の ときまで 取っておくため ほとんど 動こうとしない。 なにも 食べずに 朝露 だけを 飲んでいる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":191,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance"